		(uuid "c506a3e7-99fa-49b6-80ed-36abc97f7fde")
	)
	(text "The comms board receives +3V3 and +5V_CON from the EPS stack connectors.\nU15 provides low-loss reverse-current blocking and controlled turn-on for +5V.\nBulk capacitors and local bypass capacitors filter the distributed rails.\nVerify at least 4.5 V at the CAN controllers and RF amplifier under maximum load.\nQualify the complete system current budget, ripple and transients before flight."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 43.18 43.18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ce65f553-730e-4f66-8b21-d976d94e737a")
	)
	(text "U15 replaces D8: reverse-current blocking and low forward loss.\nR46 enables from +5V_CON; C116 sets about 25 ms turn-on at 5 V.\nC117/C118 are local bypass capacitors. Place close to U15.\nPins 2, 4 and 9 tied to GND; PG unused; DNC pad 10 isolated.\nNo copper beyond DNC land. No low-current overload protection."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 160.02 180.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "dff9fd9f-a0fc-4ef6-b029-19e115a14448")
	)
	(text "D14 isolates the Pico VSYS feed\nfrom USB-powered VSYS.\nRetain this Schottky diode.\nPico VSYS range: 1.8 to 5.5 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 279.4 81.28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f2e2d886-0180-440c-ad00-7a0cc19cf880")
	)
	(text_box "Power indicator LEDs for bench debugging. I = (3.3-2.0)/1k = 1.3mA (dim but visible). Mark R17/R18 as DNP-optional in BOM for flight."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 233.68 83.6422 0)
